This is an independent clean-room implementation inspired by concepts and
published equations in Brita A. K. Pekarsky (2015), The New Drug Reimbursement
Game, Springer, DOI 10.1007/978-3-319-08903-4. The book itself is not included.

UOGTO ontology terms are referenced under UOGTO's stated CC-BY-4.0 licensing
for ontology/documentation. Software integrations remain subject to the
licences of their respective repositories. See ecosystem.lock.toml and
DEPENDENCY_MIGRATION_PLAN.md.

Paignia's paignia-core and paignia-solve packages are the renamed generic Rust
seed formerly called uogto-game-core and uogto-game-solve in this repository.
Their original Apache-2.0 contributor attribution is retained. Source revision,
paths and rename provenance are recorded in extraction-manifest.json. No Kairos
or UOGTO implementation or ontology asset is copied by this rename; a later
transfer must preserve the applicable source licence and attribution separately.
